SunshineOS live repair and migration environment.

Read-only first:
  sunshine-health --deep
  sunshine-sanity --require-snapshot
  sunshine-rescue
  sunshine-report

Automatic Arch-family evolution (base, kernel, packages and migration):
  sunshine-update            preview (read-only)
  sunshine-update --apply    execute after sanity and snapshot gates

Edge cases only (non-Arch source, rescue from the live environment):
  sunshine-rescue            read-only Arch-native assessment
  sunshine-migrate --apply --source arch --trust-index ... --trust-policy ... --trust-keyring ...

Every command writes a JSON report under /var/log/sunshine/reports
and journals decisions in /var/log/sunshine/journal.jsonl.
